Portrait of a fantasy D&D character. A stocky, weathered human man in his 50s. Short grey hair, scar on his chin. No-nonsense expression — tired, competent, done with everyone's bullshit. Wearing battered scale mail armor with dents and scratches. A longsword at his hip that has seen better days. Sheriff/lawman vibe. Background: wooden docks at dawn, fishing boats. Style: realistic fantasy portrait, cool morning light, waist-up.
